{"tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"warranty_2006 - warranty_2005","variables":{"warranty_2006":{"value":10,"source":"source:q11n3","unit":"USD_million"},"warranty_2005":{"value":4,"source":"source:q11n4","unit":"USD_million"}}},"message":"The change in the reserve for product warranties is the 2006 balance minus the 2005 balance. Source q11 states the reserve was $10 million at Dec. 31, 2006 and $4 million at Dec. 31, 2005; both amounts are in USD millions."}